00:10:15.701 --> 00:10:17.334
-September.
That's eight months.

00:10:17.334 --> 00:10:20.667
That's 240-ish days.

00:10:20.667 --> 00:10:23.934
I'm here minimum
three times a week.

00:10:23.934 --> 00:10:25.467
Which means
that since you moved,

00:10:25.467 --> 00:10:28.000
I have been here 90 times.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.968
-Must be the place to be,
I guess.

00:10:30.968 --> 00:10:33.767
-Or just the place
I always am.

00:10:33.767 --> 00:10:36.200
-Lizzy Caplan, everybody!

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:40.734
"Fatal Attraction" premieres
this Sunday on Paramount+.

00:10:40.734 --> 00:10:42.167
More "Tonight Show"
after the break.

00:10:42.167 --> 00:10:43.801
Stick around, everybody.
Lizzy Caplan!

